          "title": "Overview",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "text": "The Ashfell landslide caused damage to the lower road and prompted warnings and evacuations across Withel terraces, <PERSON>, and Ashfell bench.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.1"
            },
            {
              "text": "Service disruptions impacted Ashfell bench, the lower road, and Corvane mine, while approximately 60 households were displaced from Cranmoor.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.2"
            },
            {
              "text": "The mine operator and independent panel held regulatory meetings, leading to revised company policies, infrastructure restoration on the lower road, and coordinated relief in affected areas.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.3"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
